<section id="about" class="section about-section"><div class="container about-grid"><div class="about-card"><span class="quote-mark">“</span><p>Your future is a journey. SmartCareer helps you discover your direction and prepare for what comes next.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Why SmartCareer</span><h2>Career planning should feel empowering, not overwhelming.</h2><p>SmartCareer is designed to help university students better understand themselves, explore career opportunities, identify skill gaps, and prepare for future careers through personalised guidance.</p><div class="about-points"><span>Student-centred by design</span><span>Honest progress, never fabricated results</span><span>Built for steady, practical growth</span></div></div></div></section>

